---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="支持本站 | 冰山图宇宙">
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">

    <div class="text-center mb-10 reveal">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono text-text-mid mb-3 tracking-widest">[ SUPPORT ]</div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-mono font-semibold">
        <span class="text-warning">#</span> 支持本站
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-body font-mono mt-2 max-w-md mx-auto">冰山图宇宙是一个独立开发项目，你的每一份支持都让这个平台走得更远。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <!-- 代码贡献 -->
      <a href="https://github.com/Gnix807/icebergs-1.0" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
        class="border border-border bg-surface-2 p-6 text-center hover:border-success transition-colors flex flex-col items-center justify-center reveal group" style="animation-delay:50ms">
        <div class="text-xl mb-3">💻</div>
        <div class="text-sm font-mono font-bold text-success mb-2">贡献代码</div>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-text-mid font-mono mb-4">项目完全开源，欢迎提交 PR</p>
        <span class="px-4 py-1.5 border border-success/30 text-success text-xs font-mono group-hover:bg-success/10 transition-colors">GitHub →</span>
      </a>

      <!-- 分享传播 -->
      <div class="border border-border bg-surface-2 p-6 text-center flex flex-col items-center justify-center reveal" style="animation-delay:100ms">
        <div class="text-xl mb-3">📢</div>
        <div class="text-sm font-mono font-bold text-info mb-2">分享传播</div>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-text-mid font-mono mb-4">把冰山图分享给更多人，就是最好的支持</p>
        <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-text-lo">让更多人发现水面之下的世界</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>
